ght:700;color:#2563eb;\">Column Config</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(139,92,246,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed;\">Attribute Mappings</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706;\">Bulk Upload</span></div></div></div></div>"
